  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">如有問題：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/3rE684haVk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1248690132425375847/1495053312515510482/description_fc26bb7e-a0ba-4d78-8450-b7470b040a36.png?ex=69e4d866&is=69e386e6&hm=d59a09cc174000076260f750b003537fda85f26d731219d8f0edbf568e1fd3b9&\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\" height=\"215\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">^Discord^</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">自訂傳送門 API</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此函式庫模組讓開發者能輕鬆建立通往自訂維度的傳送門。這些自訂傳送門的功能將與下界傳送門完全相同，但可完全自訂。您可以控制邊框方塊、傳送門方塊，或設定預設值、點燃源與目標地的著色等更多選項！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由 Waterpicker 將 <a href=\"https://github.com/kyrptonaught/customportalapi\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/kyrptonaught/customportalapi</a> 直接移植至 Forge :D</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">更多資訊請見 <a href=\"https://github.com/Waterpicker/customportalapi/blob/1.18.1-forge/README.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Waterpicker/customportalapi/blob/1.18.1-forge/README.md</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">圖示為來自《亞特蘭提斯》的亞特蘭提斯傳送門 :D<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftitan3dworks.com%252fcollections%252fminecraft%252fproducts%252fminecraft-lantern-lamp-led-perfect-gift-for-gamers-amp-fans%253faff%253d2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/944464/description_5c73b43a-40e7-4fe1-9cca-24f77889d022.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"139\"></a></em></h1>",
